            <ArticleTitle>[Development ideas of fine pharmaceutical materials of traditional Chinese medicine preparations based on active cluster theory].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2566-2570</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4268/cjcmm20161333</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The pharmaceutical materials are divided into coarse and fine types in the development of traditional Chinese medicine preparations. Fine materials with clear composition, stable content and high quality control conform to the international development trend of traditional Chinese medicine preparations. In this paper, the status of fine materials was analyzed, and the development ideas were tentatively put forward. On the one hand, the study on simple methods and efficient equipment shall be strengthened for the simultaneous separation of multiple components of traditional Chinese medicine; on the other hand, the knowledge for traditional Chinese medicine shall be broadened to further develop the scientific compatibility of monomers under the guidance of the theory of traditional Chinese medicine.</AbstractText>
